    },
    {
      "t": "Return the tofu",
      "x": "Stir the tofu back in and simmer 5 min until thick enough to sit on a tortilla without running. Mash a few beans against the side if it needs thickening. Stir in lime juice and coriander.",
      "uses": [
        "1.14",
